{"request_id":"sha256:c73967f7bcff629d373ba881c395f3eae9cec03cded784d12fac1accdfed4e4f","units":[{"unit_id":"sha256:b310efaf23ffc795abfa6e1ffd47d0b90d24cdea5182ce7ab1036ff0e9320e8c","reviewed":true,"findings":[{"kind":"AVAILABLE_CAPACITY","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — combined domestic manufacturing footprint (in-house manufacturing facility and partnership with Flex), microinverters","timing":"2025 fiscal year (as of December 31, 2025)","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":809,"text":"These arrangements maintained a combined manufacturing capacity of approximately five-million microinverters per quarter."},"reason":"Reported current available physical manufacturing capacity of approximately five million microinverters per quarter for the registrant's combined U.S. manufacturing arrangements (in-house facility plus Flex partnership). This is a quarterly capacity figure and is not annualized."},{"kind":"ACTUAL_PRODUCTION","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — microinverter units sold","timing":"Year ended December 31, 2025","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":883,"text":"During the year ended December 31, 2025, we sold approximately 6.4 million microinverter units and shipped 706.1 MWh of IQ Batteries, as compared to approximately 6.5 million microinverter units and 521 MWh of IQ Batteries shipped in the year ended December 31, 2024."},"reason":"Reported microinverter unit volume for the year ended December 31, 2025 (approximately 6.4 million units). This is a units-sold/shipment figure, not a production quantity, so it is not usable as actual production for a utilization ratio."},{"kind":"SALES_OR_SHIPMENTS","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — IQ Batteries shipped","timing":"Year ended December 31, 2025","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":883,"text":"During the year ended December 31, 2025, we sold approximately 6.4 million microinverter units and shipped 706.1 MWh of IQ Batteries, as compared to approximately 6.5 million microinverter units and 521 MWh of IQ Batteries shipped in the year ended December 31, 2024."},"reason":"706.1 MWh of IQ Batteries shipped in the year ended December 31, 2025 is a shipment quantity, not actual production, and is in energy units (MWh) that do not match the microinverter-unit capacity measure."},{"kind":"CAPACITY_QUALITATIVE","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — third-party contract manufacturers' production capacity","timing":"2025 fiscal year (as of December 31, 2025)","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":834,"text":"We believe our contract manufacturing partners have sufficient production capacity to meet the anticipated demand for our products for the foreseeable future."},"reason":"Qualitative statement that contract manufacturing partners have sufficient production capacity to meet anticipated demand; no comparable actual-output/capacity pair is provided, so no utilization ratio can be computed."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — domestic manufacturing footprint and tax credit qualification","timing":"2025 fiscal year (as of December 31, 2025)","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":809,"text":"To mitigate supply chain risks and tariff exposure and to leverage U.S. manufacturing incentives, we continued to operate our domestic manufacturing footprint, including our in‑house manufacturing facility and our partnership with Flex."},"reason":"Contextual description of the registrant's domestic manufacturing arrangements and incentives; it identifies the facilities underlying the capacity figure but contains no separate actual-output or capacity quantity."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — manufacturing facility and warehouse, Arlington, U.S.","timing":"2025 fiscal year (as of December 31, 2025)","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":737,"text":"Manufacturing facility and warehouse facilityArlington, U.S.Leased227,344Jan-2031"},"reason":"Property table entry giving leased square footage (227,344 sq ft) for a manufacturing facility and warehouse; square footage is not a production-capacity quantity and no output measure is paired with it."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — manufacturing and test equipment, U.S. manufacturing facility improvements","timing":"Year ended December 31, 2025","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":1000,"text":"$40.6 million used in purchases of test and assembly equipment for U.S. manufacturing related facility improvements and information technology enhancements, including capitalized costs related to internal-use software"},"reason":"Capital expenditure on test and assembly equipment for U.S. manufacturing; a monetary investment amount, not a production or capacity quantity."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — open purchase obligations for component inventory","timing":"As of December 31, 2025","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":986,"text":"As of December 31, 2025, we had open purchase obligations of $252.3 million related to component inventory that we and our primary contract manufacturers procure on our behalf in accordance with our production forecast as well as other inventory related purchase commitments."},"reason":"Monetary purchase obligations tied to a production forecast; not an actual production quantity or available capacity measure."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — LFP battery cell supplier capacity","timing":"2025 fiscal year (as of December 31, 2025)","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":819,"text":"identifying qualified suppliers with the necessary expertise and capacity remains challenging"},"reason":"Statement about supplier qualification and capacity challenges for LFP battery cells; no registrant production or capacity quantity is given."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — microinverters shipped cumulative","timing":"As of December 31, 2025","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":804,"text":"As of December 31, 2025, we have shipped approximately 86.4 million microinverters, and more than 5.1 million Enphase residential and commercial systems have been deployed in over 160 countries."},"reason":"Cumulative shipments since inception (approximately 86.4 million microinverters); a shipment figure, not actual production or available capacity, and not period-matched to the quarterly capacity measure."},{"kind":"OTHER_CONTEXT","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — AMPTC benefits for U.S. manufactured microinverters and IQ Batteries","timing":"Year ended December 31, 2025","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":899,"text":"The AMPTC benefits recognized were $238.7 million for the year ended December 31, 2025, as compared to $157.5 million for the same period in 2024."},"reason":"Monetary tax credit benefit associated with U.S. manufactured products; not a production or capacity quantity."}],"unresolved":[{"kind":"AVAILABLE_CAPACITY","subject":"Enphase Energy, Inc. — combined domestic manufacturing capacity (microinverters per quarter)","timing":"2025 fiscal year (as of December 31, 2025)","evidence":{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":809,"text":"These arrangements maintained a combined manufacturing capacity of approximately five-million microinverters per quarter."},"reason":"The available capacity is stated as approximately five million microinverters per quarter, while the only period-matched output figures are annual units sold/shipped (approximately 6.4 million microinverter units sold in the year ended December 31, 2025) and battery shipments in MWh. Because the capacity is quarterly and the output is annual and expressed as sales/shipments rather than production, and the units/scopes do not align, a utilization ratio cannot be computed without annualizing quarterly capacity or treating sales as production, both of which are prohibited. The quantity role (capacity vs. output) and scope alignment remain unresolved."}]}]}